cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Beehave in your work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Beehave"
abstract: >-
  Beehave reads BehaviorTree.CPP behavior trees and shows only the actions a
  robot can take, in order, with the conditions that lead to each one. It
  turns BehaviorTree.CPP v3 XML into an action graph rendered as text,
  Mermaid, Graphviz DOT or JSON.
authors:
  - given-names: Erwin
    family-names: Lejeune
repository-code: "https://github.com/guilyx/beehave"
url: "https://guilyx.github.io/beehave/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0.dev0
date-released: "2026-10-14"
keywords:
  - behavior trees
  - BehaviorTree.CPP
  - robotics
  - ROS 2
  - static analysis
  - visualization
